  "description": "Two people who hate to lose, in love?!\n\n*“Let’s go out with me, not my brother.”*\n\nI just wanted to get to know him, but he suddenly came to me asking me to go out with him instead of hyung, so I agreed thinking that I would make him try really hard. However, once we get to know each other, unexpected feelings begin to arise... a tight and sweet love battle between two male high schoolers who cannot back down. \n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
